# 🔥 Feature Engineering

Feature Engineering means creating new useful features from existing data.

Example:

* Runs and Balls → Strike Rate
* Salary and Expenses → Savings

Good features improve model performance significantly.

---

# ✅ Mathematical Feature Engineering

```python
import pandas as pd

data = {
    'Name': ['Rahul', 'Priya', 'Kiran'],
    'Salary': [50000, 80000, 45000],
    'Expenses': [35000, 60000, 40000],
    'Age': [25, 32, 22]
}

df = pd.DataFrame(data)

df['Savings'] = df['Salary'] - df['Expenses']

df['Savings_Rate'] = (
    df['Savings'] / df['Salary']
)

print(df)
```

---

# ✅ Date Feature Engineering

```python
import pandas as pd

data = {
    'Order_Date': [
        '2024-01-15',
        '2024-03-22',
        '2024-07-08'
    ]
}

df = pd.DataFrame(data)

df['Order_Date'] = pd.to_datetime(df['Order_Date'])

df['Year'] = df['Order_Date'].dt.year

df['Month'] = df['Order_Date'].dt.month

df['Day'] = df['Order_Date'].dt.day

df['DayOfWeek'] = df['Order_Date'].dt.dayofweek

df['Quarter'] = df['Order_Date'].dt.quarter

print(df)
```

