# ✅ Binning

```python
import pandas as pd

ages = [5, 15, 25, 35, 45, 55, 65]

df = pd.DataFrame({'Age': ages})

df['Age_Group'] = pd.cut(
    df['Age'],
    bins=[0, 12, 18, 35, 60, 100],
    labels=[
        'Child',
        'Teen',
        'Young Adult',
        'Adult',
        'Senior'
    ]
)

print(df)
```

